sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Citizen
    participant A as Mobile app
    participant Q as Offline queue
    participant API as Core API
    participant V as Vision (ONNX)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/PostGIS
    participant R as RAG service
    participant L as LLM (Hugging Face)

    U->>A: Take photo
    A->>A: Read GPS, speed, heading<br/>generate device_report_id
    alt Network available
        A->>API: POST /reports (multipart)
    else Offline
        A->>Q: Enqueue report
        Q-->>A: Stored locally
        Note over Q,API: Delivered on reconnection
        Q->>API: POST /reports (retry)
    end
    API->>API: Save photo, assign report_id
    API->>V: infer(image)
    V-->>API: score, confidence
    API->>DB: find_or_join_cluster(lat, lon, 5 m)
    DB-->>API: cluster_id or none
    alt Cluster found (confirmed)
        opt score ≥ 3
            API->>R: POST /generate {lat, lon, score}
            R->>R: Resolve road type, retrieve top-5 rules
            R->>L: Prompt with rules
            L-->>R: Draft sheet
            R->>R: Citation guard (or fallback template)
            R-->>API: sheet_text, citations, target_office
        end
    end
    API->>DB: INSERT report (status new/confirmed/sheet_sent)
    API-->>A: 201 {report_id, status, score, sheet_summary?}
    A-->>U: Result screen
